// hr_c06: Hive City remaster, the red corridor (camera c06).
// No ReflectScale anywhere (the owner: floors too reflective); the floor kept low in smoothness. smoothness scales the _gloss map (R smoothness, G metalness, from the CC0 sets).
// pxmat (2026-11-24): + ReliefScale (parallax, textures/<name>_hmap), ReflectScale on metal/glass/lamps (floors stay dry), detailmap.
